# HELP sglang:load_back_bytes_total Bytes loaded back from local host DRAM (L2) to GPU, all pools combined, including draft/sidecar transfers that the token counter excludes. Each rank reports its own KV shard; sum ranks for the physical total. A window's byte delta divided by the same window's load_back_duration_seconds sum is the bytes-weighted active bandwidth; the plain rate is wall-clock payload traffic that includes idle time.
